rule ProtectEmergencyReserveFirst
	statement: Protect the emergency reserve before suggesting prepayment, investment or a mandate transfer. The reserve target is the customer's emergencyReserveMonths preference applied to essential outgoings; a goal gap is not a reason to spend the reserve.
	lineageTag: df640953-d454-58bb-9d3f-a5bd825c6dce

	ruleReferencedEntity Goal
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Name

		ruleReferencedProperty TargetInr

		ruleReferencedProperty CurrentInr

	ruleReferencedEntity Preference
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty PreferenceValue
